Here we are [C]
[C]Stuck by this river,
[Am]You and I
[Am]Underneath a sky that's ever falling
[F]down, down, down
[Am]Ever falling down.

Through the day
As if on an ocean
Waiting here,
Always failing to remember why we
  came, came, came:
I wonder why we came.

You talk to me
as if from a distance
And I reply
With impressions chosen from another
  time, time, time,
From another time.
